--- !u!114 &927890769
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 927890766}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e85cb56be4a113641b8a13eb24726014, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  languageData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eb0c907e1bf9b3e4b9c51bdece2e7eb6, type: 2}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 592162459}
  sfxFeedback: {fileID: 1191685760}
  phrases:
  - english: Lucifer fell again.
    chinese: "\u8DEF\u897F\u6CD5\u518D\u6B21\u5815\u843D\u3002"
    portuguese: "\"L\xFAcifer caiu de novo.\""
    spanish: "Lucifer cay\xF3 otra vez."
    duration: 1.5
  - english: But he had learned from the first fall.
    chinese: "\u4F46\u4ED6\u4ECE\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B21\u5815\u843D\u4E2D\u5B66\u5230\u4E86\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
    portuguese: '"Mas ele aprendeu com a primeira queda."'
    spanish: "Pero hab\xEDa aprendido de la primera ca\xEDda."
    duration: 1.5
  - english: "And with the second\u2026 he left something behind."
    chinese: "\u800C\u5728\u7B2C\u4E8C\u6B21...... \u4ED6\u7559\u4E0B\u4E86\u67D0\u6837\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
    portuguese: "\"E com a segunda\u2026 deixou algo para tr\xE1s.\""
    spanish: "Y con la segunda\u2026 dej\xF3 algo atr\xE1s."
    duration: 2
  - english: The Exorcist triumphed. But what emerged from the battle...
    chinese: "\u9A71\u9B54\u4EBA\u53D6\u5F97\u4E86\u80DC\u5229\u3002\u4F46\u4ECE\u6218\u6597\u4E2D\u8D70\u51FA\u7684\u90A3\u4E2A\u5B58\u5728\u2026\u2026"
    portuguese: O Exorcista triunfou. Mas o que emergiu da batalha...
    spanish: "El Exorcista triunf\xF3. Pero lo que emergi\xF3 de la batalla..."
    duration: 1.5
  - english: no longer carried his name.
    chinese: "\u5DF2\u4E0D\u518D\u662F\u4ED6\u3002"
    portuguese: "j\xE1 n\xE3o carregava seu nome."
    spanish: ya no llevaba su nombre.
    duration: 2
  - english: And in the silence between worlds, something stirs.
    chinese: "\u5728\u4E16\u754C\u4E4B\u95F4\u7684\u5BC2\u9759\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u67D0\u79CD\u4E1C\u897F\u6B63\u5728\u82CF\u9192\u3002"
    portuguese: "E no sil\xEAncio entre mundos, algo desperta."
    spanish: Y en el silencio entre mundos, algo despierta.
    duration: 1.5
  - english: No haste. No shape.
    chinese: "\u4E0D\u6025\u4E0D\u7F13\uFF0C\u65E0\u5F62\u65E0\u72B6\u3002"
    portuguese: Sem pressa. Sem forma.
    spanish: Sin prisa. Sin forma.
    duration: 0.8
  - english: Waiting for its time.
    chinese: "\u9759\u9759\u7B49\u5F85\u7740\u5B83\u7684\u65F6\u673A\u3002"
    portuguese: Aguardando sua hora.
    spanish: Esperando su momento.
    duration: 4
  uiText: {fileID: 1214605865}
  canvasGroup: {fileID: 927890768}
  fadeTime: 1.5
